    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"letting it be\" isn't enough. it's just hanging in this limbo where i'm waiting for something that's never coming back. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person staring back. it's like i should have just finished while the music was still beautiful, instead of waiting to watch it rot. i'd rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
